OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Mon 17 Aug to Wed 26 Aug
OL,6,FInto the start of next week frontal
OL,7,Fsystems will likely approach or move
OL,8,Facross the UK from the Atlantic. These
OL,9,Fwill bring bring rain to many parts of
OL,10,Fthe UK, although any heavy rain will
OL,11,Fprobably be across high ground in the
OL,12,Fnorthwest. Temperatures will likely be
OL,13,Fnear normal or slightly above. Later
OL,14,Fin the period, high pressure will
OL,15,Fprobably have more of an influence
OL,16,Fwith drier conditions developing for
OL,17,Fmany. Some rain is still possible at
OL,18,Ftimes, particularly in the north,
OL,19,Ftogether with a risk of thunderstorms
OL,20,Fin the south. Temperatures will likely
OL,21,Fbe above normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
